📄 Changelog - v2.1.0 (Pro Release)
Added
• Payment Method Tags: Added credit card, debit card, cash, and bank transfer badges/tags for subscriptions and one-off expenses.
• Real-Time Currency Exchange Rates: Integrated live currency rates fetching via CurrencyExchangeManager with offline caching.
• Currency Converter Tool: Added a quick currency conversion utility inside Settings.
• One-off Expenses Tab: Added a dedicated "Expenses" tab in bottom navigation for shopping, transfers, and single expenses.
• Statistical Bar Chart: Added MPAndroidChart BarChart in Analytics for Income vs Expense comparison.
• Smart Financial Insights: Added yearly expense projection and AI-inspired savings tips in Analytics.
• Custom Categories: Enabled users to create and select custom categories dynamically.
• Brand Logos & Favicons: Integrated Google Favicon API and local vector brand icons for popular subscriptions (Netflix, Spotify, YouTube, etc.).
• Background Notifications (WorkManager): Configured periodic background worker for automated payment reminders.
Changed
• Multi-Currency Normalization: Upgraded analytics and summary calculations to automatically convert all foreign currencies (USD, EUR, GBP) to default currency using live exchange rates.
• Selection Dialogs: Upgraded single-choice settings and dialogs to use radio buttons (`setSingleChoiceItems`) displaying current selections clearly.
• Theme Architecture: Refactored layouts to fully support dynamic Light and Dark modes using Material DayNight color attributes.
Fixed
• Fixed app exit issue when pressing back from Settings activity.
• Expanded "Reset All Data" to completely wipe subscriptions, incomes, expenses, and app settings.